<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 18.5.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 18.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 70,000 shares in Mostostal Warszawa at 18.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Mostostal Warszawa was trading at 17.6 zlotys in 72,861-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
